== Trivia ==
* Bloodshot Eye was originally an unofficial item which was supposed to showcase the modding capabilities of Afterbirth+ in the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FRR-wzTky9Q PAX 2016 livestream]. However, all items included in the demo were later added to the final game.

